{% extends 'legal/_layout.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Privacy · {{ site.name }}{% endblock %}
{% block meta_description %}What {{ site.domain }} stores about you, why, and for how long.{% endblock %}

{% block doc_title %}Privacy{% endblock %}
{% block doc_subtitle %}Version {{ version }}. Short, because there is not much to say.{% endblock %}

{% block doc_body %}
    <p>
        The site is run by <strong>{{ site.operator }}</strong>, who is the data
        controller for everything below. Contact:
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we store, and why</h2>

    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr><th>Data</th><th>Why</th><th>How long</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Your email address, if you register</td>
                <td>To sign you in, and to reach you about a listing you submitted. Legal basis: performing the service you asked for.</td>
                <td>Until you ask us to delete the account.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Sign-in codes (a keyed hash, never the code itself)</td>
                <td>To check the code you type.</td>
                <td>Ten minutes, then purged daily.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Listings you submit, and who submitted them</td>
                <td>To publish the calendar and to know who to ask about a listing. Legal basis: performing the service.</td>
                <td>While the listing is on the site. Past events stay reachable at their URL unless removed.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Your email address, if you subscribe to the newsletter</td>
                <td>To send you the monthly digest. Legal basis: your consent, given by clicking the confirmation link.</td>
                <td>Until you unsubscribe. Unconfirmed addresses are deleted after 30 days.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Server logs (IP address, page requested, time)</td>
                <td>To keep the site running and to stop abuse. Legal basis: legitimate interest.</td>
                <td>Up to 30 days.</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>What we do not do</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>No advertising, no tracking pixels, no analytics that identify you.</li>
        <li>No selling or sharing of addresses with organisers or anyone else.</li>
        <li>No profiling. The newsletter is the same for everyone.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who else touches the data</h2>
    <p>
        The site is hosted on servers in the European Union. Email is sent through a
        transactional email provider, which sees the addresses it delivers to. Public
        forms are protected against bots by Cloudflare Turnstile, which sets no cookies
        and does not identify you. Fonts are served from our own server, so no font
        provider sees your visit.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
        One session cookie, only when you sign in, so the site knows it is you from one
        page to the next. Nothing else. There is no cookie banner because there is
        nothing to consent to.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
        You can ask what we hold about you, ask for it to be corrected or deleted, and
        withdraw consent to the newsletter at any time by using the unsubscribe link or
        by writing to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>. You can
        also complain to the data protection authority in your country.
    </p>
{% endblock %}

{% block doc_footer %}
    Version {{ version }}.
{% endblock %}
